        "id": 45456,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-21T04:04:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is a awesome idea. I would follow it, but I don't think regular people would hold up well with it. The way I tend to do it (especially when using the playmat) is if it effects all heroes I put it in the center, if it effects all villians I would put it just outside the line of the villian's section, same with environments outside the environment section. Now if it&nbsp; effects everyone I put the token in the area that the environment, villian, and players section meet up.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
