        "raw": "<p>That is a awesome idea. I would follow it, but I don&#39;t think regular people would hold up well with it. The way I tend to do it (especially when using the playmat) is if it effects all heroes I put it in the center, if it effects all villians I would put it just outside the line of the villian&#39;s section, same with environments outside the environment section. Now if it&nbsp; effects everyone I put the token in the area that the environment, villian, and players section meet up.</p>",
