        "id": 45460,
        "name": "Mezike",
        "username": "Mezike",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-24T19:18:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have been having thoughts along a similar line so made up a couple of cards to do this. However I prefer to have separate cards as I can just chuck tokens on the card without worrying about which part of the card it is on.</p>\n<p>You can check em out here: <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/images/user/286862/mezike\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.boardgamegeek.com/images/user/286862/mezike</a></p>\n<p>I've also put together a card to indicate when a Hero is facing their Nemesis as it's something I constantly forget to apply, it's designed to either sit beside the Hero or tuck underneath showing whichever side is easiest to use. There are some familiar faces on this one  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>I hope there's no problem with using Adam's art on the background, if there is then I will naturally pull them.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:19:00.394Z",
